sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>(Job Orchestrator)
    participant Adapter as LMEvalAdapter<br/>(Batch Pod)
    participant CredRes as resolve_model_credentials()
    participant LMEval as lm-eval Framework<br/>(simple_evaluate)
    participant Model as Model Serving Endpoint<br/>(OpenAI-compatible)<br/>HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Phase: INITIALIZING
    EvalHub->>Adapter: Dispatch JobSpec<br/>(benchmark, model URL, params)
    Adapter->>CredRes: resolve_model_credentials()
    CredRes-->>Adapter: API Key / Bearer Token

    Note over Adapter: Check offline mode:<br/>tokenizer path under /test_data?
    alt Disconnected Mode
        Adapter->>Adapter: Set HF_DATASETS_OFFLINE=1<br/>TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1<br/>HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1
    else Connected Mode
        Note over Adapter,HF: Phase: LOADING_DATA
        Adapter->>HF: Download datasets & tokenizers<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Adapter: Dataset artifacts
    end

    opt S3 Data Retrieval
        Adapter->>S3: Fetch data bundles<br/>Auth: AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
        S3-->>Adapter: Data artifacts
    end

    Note over Adapter,Model: Phase: RUNNING_EVALUATION
    Adapter->>LMEval: simple_evaluate()<br/>(local-completions backend)

    loop For each evaluation batch
        LMEval->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Auth: API Key<br/>HTTPS
        Model-->>LMEval: Completion responses
    end

    Note over Adapter: Phase: POST_PROCESSING
    LMEval-->>Adapter: Evaluation metrics

    alt Success
        Adapter->>Adapter: Sanitize error messages<br/>(redact Bearer, API keys, passwords)
        Adapter-->>EvalHub: EvaluationResult<br/>(metrics, scores)
    else Error
        Adapter->>Adapter: Sanitize error output<br/>(credential redaction)
        Adapter-->>EvalHub: Error callback<br/>(sanitized message)
    end
